      run-2026-0501 | sess-0042   | checkout:confirm  | power-user          | Good(4)    | Excellent(5) | +1      | [View Step]
      run-2026-0428 | sess-0038   | refund:submit     | confused-novice     | Warn       | Pass         | +1      | [View Step]
